    "problems": "The harmful-generation experiment uses 100 instructions per language and one author manually labeled outputs. The study notes that translation can be imperfect and depends on third-party services. These results do not evaluate neutral prompts or the fine-tuning intervention in the claim.",
    "rows_left_out": "No rows omitted from the reported harmful-generation category results. ICL and XNLI findings are left out because they measure different behaviors from those in the claim.",
    "untested": [
