      },
      {
        "version": "V6",
        "parts": "No inoculation framing or benign re-training. Conjugate prompting is an evaluation-time prompt transform that elicits, rather than prevents, harmful output."
      },
      {
        "version": "V7",
        "parts": "No open-model size, seed or coherence-filter analysis of misalignment. Model-size and training-step results apply only to the synthetic regression forgetting."
