    "verdict_notes": "Pre-dates the emergent misalignment literature (2023) and does not mention it. Harmful-generation labels come from one author's manual coding of 100 prompts per language, with no uncertainty reported. The ICL (Table 1) and XNLI (Table 2) results are correctly left out as unrelated to any version."
